{%- comment -%}
  The drawer's static styles, cached as one file: shopify/assets/cart-drawer.css
  holds cart-drawer-addons, this snippet, cart-drawer-polish and
  cart-drawer-sheets, in that order. Storelib moves the link into the head in
  the place these styles held, so the cascade is unchanged.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} The drawer is closed at first paint: off the cart page its styles load without holding the page. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if template != 'cart' -%}<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'cart-drawer.css' | asset_url }}" media="print" onload="this.media='all'"><noscript>{{ 'cart-drawer.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}</noscript>{%- else -%}{{ 'cart-drawer.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}{%- endif -%}